  }


  /** helper function to check ProcessOutcomeCorrelator_supervisorProcess_processOutcomeCorrelator's
   * output ports.  Use named arguments to check subsets of the output ports.
   * @param outcomeToAuthorization method that will be called with the value of the outgoing data
